examples.question_text:
Asha travels out along a road, stops twice, then returns to the start along the same road.

[tikz]
% mathsmap-diagram-colours {"version":1,"kind":"graph","base":[],"semantic":[]}
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=8mm,y=3.333333mm,every node/.style={text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont}]
\definecolor{blue}{HTML}{268CFF}
\definecolor{housegrid}{HTML}{CCCCCC}
\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes="1"/>}
\draw[housegrid,line width=.25pt,xstep=2mm,ystep=3.333333mm] (0,0) grid (6.5,21);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(7,0);
\draw[black,->] (0,0)--(0,22.5);
\foreach \t in {1,2,3,4,5,6} {\draw[black] (\t,0)--++(0,-.3);\node[below,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (\t,-.3) {\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text="tick">}$\t$\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}
\foreach \d in {3,6,9,12,15,18,21} {\draw[black] (0,\d)--++(-.15,0);\node[left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (-.15,\d) {\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text="tick">}$\d$\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};}
\node[below left,font=\fontsize{8.5}{10}\selectfont] at (0,0) {\special{dvisvgm:raw <g data-graph-text="tick">}$0$\special{dvisvgm:raw </g>}};
\draw[blue,line width=.8pt] (0,0)--(1.5,9)--(2.5,9)--(4,21)--(5,21)--(6.5,0);
\path (-1.5,10.5) node[rotate=90] {Distance from start (km)};
\path (3.25,-2.2) node[below] {Time (hours)};
\path (3.25,23) node[above] {Asha's journey};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

(a) How far from the start is she after $3.5$ hours?

(b) On the outward journey, when is she $15$ km from the start?

(c) For how long in total does she stop?

(d) Describe the last moving stage and compare its speed with the first moving stage.

(e) Find the total distance travelled.

