\path (6.5,39) node[blue,above left] {Maya};
\path (1,32.4) node[red,above right] {Ellis};
\path (-1.5,21) node[rotate=90] {Distance from start (km)};
\path (3.5,-4.5) node[below] {Time (hours)};
\path (3.5,46) node[above] {Two riders on the same road};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

At what time do they pass, and how far from Maya’s starting point are they?

examples.solution_text:
